{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49549","headline":"金浮图 · 尹鹗","name":"金浮图","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"繁华地，王孙富贵。\n玳瑁筵开，下朝无事。\n压红茵，凤舞黄金翅。\n玉立纤腰，一片揭天歌吹。\n满目绮罗珠翠，和风淡荡，偷散沈檀气。\n堪判醉，韶光正媚。\n折尽牡丹，艳迷人意。\n金张许史应难比，贪恋欢娱，不觉金乌坠。\n还惜会难别易，金船更劝，勒住花骢辔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"尹鹗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49549.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49549","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}